      "text": "Name",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "nmblookup — NetBIOS over TCP/IP client used to lookup NetBIOS names",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Synopsis",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] [[[p1]]|[[p2]]] [[[p3]]] [[[p4]]|[[p5]]] [[[p6]]|[[p7]]] [[[p8]]|[[p9]]] [[[p10]]|[[p11]]=BROADCAST-ADDRESS] [[[p12]]|[[p13]]=UNICAST-ADDRESS] [[[p14]]|[[p15]]] [[[p16]]|[[p17]]] [-?|[[p18]]] [[[p19]]] [[[p20]]|[[p21]]=DEBUGLEVEL] [[[p22]]] [[[p23]]=CONFIGFILE] [[[p24]]=name=value] [[[p25]]|[[p26]]=LOGFILEBASE] [[[p27]]] [[[p28]]] [[[p29]]|[[p30]]=NAME-RESOLVE-ORDER] [[[p31]]|[[p32]]=SOCKETOPTIONS] [[[p33]]|[[p34]]=MAXPROTOCOL] [[[p35]]|[[p36]]=NETBIOSNAME] [[[p37]]=SCOPE] [[[p38]]|[[p39]]=WORKGROUP] [[[p40]]=REALM] {name}",
      "protected": [
